{"id":"c9ef13719785316e","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound.md","title":"恒等式去随机化蕴含电路下界的析取","display":"thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound — 恒等式去随机化蕴含电路下界的析取","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound","aliases":["28-thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound"],"display":"thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound — 恒等式去随机化蕴含电路下界的析取","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]","[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]","[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-nexp]]","[[28-df-p-poly]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 20.17","source_printed_pages":"415","source_pdf_pages":"441","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound — 恒等式去随机化蕴含电路下界的析取"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e8b07be9e1b2152\" href=\"?note=0e8b07be9e1b2152\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-identity-testing\">28-df-polynomial-identity-testing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"10115bca0ef04fef\" href=\"?note=10115bca0ef04fef\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-circuit\">28-df-arithmetic-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75ba006af50075ad\" href=\"?note=75ba006af50075ad\" title=\"28-df-nexp\">28-df-nexp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" href=\"?note=bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" title=\"28-df-p-poly\">28-df-p-poly</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 20.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"415"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"441"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,k}\">\\(\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,k}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{poly}\">\\(\\operatorname{poly}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0e8b07be9e1b2152\" href=\"?note=0e8b07be9e1b2152\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-identity-testing\">28-df-polynomial-identity-testing</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{asize}\">\\(\\operatorname{asize}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"10115bca0ef04fef\" href=\"?note=10115bca0ef04fef\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-circuit\">28-df-arithmetic-circuit</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathbf{P/poly}\">\\(\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathbf{P/poly}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"75ba006af50075ad\" href=\"?note=75ba006af50075ad\" title=\"28-df-nexp\">28-df-nexp</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" href=\"?note=bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" title=\"28-df-p-poly\">28-df-p-poly</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n\">\\(S_n\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 上所有排列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(X_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}\">\\(X=(X_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}\\)</span> 为 n² 个形式变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Perm}_n(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S_n}\\prod_{i=1}^n X_{i,\\sigma(i)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Perm}_n(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S_n}\\prod_{i=1}^n X_{i,\\sigma(i)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolyPerm}_{\\mathbb Z}\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\exists C_n\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n^2}\\;(\\operatorname{asize}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{poly}(C_n)=\\operatorname{Perm}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PolyPerm}_{\\mathbb Z}\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\exists C_n\\in\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,n^2}\\;(\\operatorname{asize}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{poly}(C_n)=\\operatorname{Perm}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}\\in\\mathbf P\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\mathbf{NEXP}\\nsubseteq\\mathbf{P/poly}\\;\\lor\\;\\neg\\operatorname{PolyPerm}_{\\mathbb Z}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}\\in\\mathbf P\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\mathbf{NEXP}\\nsubseteq\\mathbf{P/poly}\\;\\lor\\;\\neg\\operatorname{PolyPerm}_{\\mathbb Z}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本项把原书 perm∉AlgP/poly 的整数、无除法电路版本在前两节内展开，避免未定义代数复杂度类。结论是两个下界至少一个成立，不能分别声称两个都成立。所计全部节点与运算门存在多项式等价；负整数常量模拟减法。已核对陈述，未完整复核 KI 证明链及其工具。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 20.17；印刷页 415；PDF 页 441。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-identity-testing","status":"resolved","id":"0e8b07be9e1b2152","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-arithmetic-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"10115bca0ef04fef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nexp","status":"resolved","id":"75ba006af50075ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nexp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p-poly","status":"resolved","id":"bdb0c5ef1940ab80","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p-poly]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-identity-testing","status":"resolved","id":"0e8b07be9e1b2152","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ZEROP}_{\\mathbb Z}$、$\\mathcal A_{\\mathbb Z,k}$、$\\operatorname{poly}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]；$\\operatorname{asize}$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]。$\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 采用 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-nexp]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。$S_n$ 为 $[n]$ 上所有排列；$X=(X_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}$ 为 n² 个形式变量。"